Subject: [PATCH] =?UTF-8?q?comms:=20fix=20check-for-updates=20loop=20?=
 =?UTF-8?q?=E2=80=94=20inline=20download+install,=20no=20notification?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Button now runs SimpleTask inline: checks GHCR digest, if newer downloads the
APK blob directly to cache and hands off to the system installer intent.
Eliminates the notification→settings→notification loop. Background 6h worker
keeps its notification (correct for background checks when user is not in app).

- REQUEST_INSTALL_PACKAGES permission added to manifest
- fileprovider_paths.xml: cache-path "updates/" for staging APK
- CommsUpdateWorker: fetchToken/fetchManifestDigest/downloadApkBlob extracted as
  package-private statics for reuse by FragmentOptionsCommsAbout
- FragmentOptionsCommsAbout: checkAndInstall() replaces checkNow() call
- strings_comms.xml: title_comms_up_to_date
